### Staff API HTTP 联调示例
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件或 JetBrains HTTP Client 直接运行
### 后端需先启动: cd backend && mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1
@storeId = 1

### ========== Dict ==========

### 获取零件分类字典项
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/PART_CATEGORY/items

### 获取支付方式字典项
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/PAYMENT_METHOD/items

### 查询不存在的字典类型（应返回空数组）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/NONEXISTENT/items

### ========== Part ==========

### 查询启用配件列表（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按配件名称搜索
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?partName=电池&pageSize=5
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按来源筛选官方配件
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?source=OFFICIAL
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取配件详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的配件（应返回 PART_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts

### ========== Inventory ==========

### 查询库存列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按配件编码搜索库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks?partCode=TEST
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取指定配件库存详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的库存（应返回错误）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks

### ========== WorkOrder ==========

### 查询工单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按客户姓名搜索工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?customerName=张三
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按状态筛选草稿工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?status=DRAFT
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按车架号搜索工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?vehicleFrameNo=FRAME001
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取工单详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的工单（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 跨门店访问（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: 2

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders
